{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act27side_level_act27side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act27side",
  "stageId": "act27side_07",
  "title": "靠著我的肩膀哭泣",
  "storyCode": "SL-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e548a16220d8791a22ba3245a05aa9947e800c5791f243adf8fb34a8e4fd7bb7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷茫的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是搞不明白，像您這樣的夫人，為什麼會每天待在礦洞裡，您不介意和感染者打交道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者不就是不幸遭遇了意外的普通人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像我的孩子，這個還未出世的孩子。將來她或許會成為感染者，也有可能只是一個幸運的普通人，與感染者成為朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但無論如何，我希望她可以生活在一座充滿愛與善意的城市裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷茫的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果繼續在這裡開採只會給環境帶來破壞的話，那是不是我們該停下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在這座城市只能依靠自然的補給，但將來這裡的人們一定可以憑藉自己的雙手開闢出自己的家園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到那時，我希望能看到你和我，和他們每個人——每個人都能在汐斯塔找到自己喜歡的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老了不必擔心，病了不必絕望，這就是我想像中的汐斯塔......是我想讓我的孩子能看到的汐斯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷茫的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的能實現嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我們就先從礦場開始吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g7_siestahightechtouristzone"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小黑羊，為什麼只剩下你一個了？你知道它們都去哪裡了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，你一直在吃這些老路牌，還有信件上的地址，也是因為你迷路了，正在找路嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......能不能聽懂我說的話......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1013_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軟綿綿的生物沒有應答，它嗅嗅聞聞，挑揀著適合入口的路牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是汐斯塔的搬遷讓你找不到去礦場的路了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是說，不是礦場，是你在未建成地塊那邊的家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "似乎有些急切地，軟綿綿的生物用蹄子刨著地面，阿黛爾站在它的身後，靜靜地等著它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......究竟要去哪裡呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "它遲疑著湊上來，腦袋貼著阿黛爾的胸口，似乎是在聆聽她的心跳。\n咚咚、咚咚、咚咚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1013_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不是這個聲音，不是這個聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軟綿綿的生物垂下頭，繼續順著眼前的路走下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在找過去的家嗎，還是過去的親人朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道該去哪裡找他們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軟綿綿的生物回過頭，好奇地看向她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "阿黛爾，你在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "現在有些數據需要你和我一起來處理一下，你能現在就來博物館嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿黛爾看著眼前充滿期待的生物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......凱勒老師，我、我今天......我今天生病了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "頭有點暈，還有點痛，我的腿也不是很舒服......我有些不舒服......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "不舒服？阿黛爾，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "要不要去醫院看一下？要不要我去看你？你手邊有藥嗎？我......你的體溫怎麼樣，有沒有發燒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，凱勒老師，我還好......我現在正在醫院！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軟綿綿的生物等不到回應，有些急切地跺跺地面，轉身準備離開。阿黛爾急忙跟了上去——\n一輛車飛馳而過，看到邁開腳步的阿黛爾，慌張地按響喇叭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘀——嘀——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，我的耳朵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛爾？你怎麼在這裡？你不是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱、凱勒老師，我、我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（果然還是我給她的壓力太大了，連阿黛爾這樣的孩子都用生病當藉口想要休息......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛爾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你覺得最近壓力很大的話，需要休息一天嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軟綿綿的生物回頭確認好阿黛爾不再會跟著它走後，輕巧地一躍，離開了這條街道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱勒老師，我想在這附近散散心......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那如果我說我想給你們這些人提供一個可以保證收入、保證病情不會快速惡化的工作呢？還會有一個專門的地方提供給你們居住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，環境和條件，還有配套的醫療我絕對會保證，你們只需要支付一部分房租給政府......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰心喪氣的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，你自己也說不下去了是不是？我不懂那些政府是怎麼想的，我只知道這些東西需要很多很多的錢，不是一百金券，也不是一千金券。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰心喪氣的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有這些錢，我可能會買一張還算舒服的床，吃點平時吃不到的東西，說不定還能必要時救我一命，但是它建不成你剛說的那些東西呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我能做到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無精打采的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生小姐，你要說建一所能給我們便宜點的醫院，我真的會很感謝你，也相信你能夠做到。但提供工作、提供住處、提供醫療......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無精打采的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看看這裡，這麼久了，我們連這裡的地塊都沒有建好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜託你們先相信我，我既然已經說了，就一定能做到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，如果真的能有這樣一個地方，你們會願意搬到那裡嗎？會對它的存在感到滿意嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰心喪氣的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "錫蘭急切起來，她感到自己的一顆心在洶湧地跳動，連帶著血液在耳朵中轟鳴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼？抱歉，我沒有太聽清......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰心喪氣的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，佩利佩先生那樣的人和財力，又是我們之前礦場工作時的老闆，幫我們也只能做到現在這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰心喪氣的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，我們又和你沒有多熟，也沒幫過你什麼，你要是以後都能來幫我們看看病，我們就很感謝你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g3_siestanewstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軟綿綿的生物走在前面，阿黛爾跟在它的身後，凱勒有些歉疚地走在阿黛爾的身邊。\n幾次猶豫後，她斟酌著開了口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛爾，你知道嗎，汐斯塔搬遷之後，城市格局仍然和之前是一樣的......順著這條路走下去，有一家咖啡館。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿黛爾腳步匆匆，好像在追趕著什麼一樣，並沒有因為這句話停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我和卡提亞還有瑪格娜就是在那家咖啡店第一次遇到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿黛爾停下腳步，眯起眼睛，試圖看清楚遠處的咖啡店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......前面那家嗎？我有些看不清招牌，是知......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知更鳥咖啡店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凱勒鬆了一口氣，換了種語氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候我還只是個學生，只是在書本上瞭解過一些生活之外的知識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡提亞和瑪格娜就像兩團火......年輕的兩團火，黑曜石的光彩都比不上他們的雙眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的父母他們那個時候......是什麼樣子的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很耀眼......很有趣，很吸引人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，也有人會覺得他們很奇怪，比起教授或者是學者，他們可能更像兩個追著火山跑的流浪漢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們喜歡亮色的衣服或者配飾，經驗會給他們更多的勇氣。他們有時會在流淌著的岩漿旁紮營，去感受岩漿流動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？噗，我以為他們會嚴令制止這種事情呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會啊，他們就會制止我去這樣做。因為之前我跟著他們去收集硫酸池中的液體，卻不小心踩進了熱水坑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡提亞把我從水裡拽出來，我還沒感覺到痛，就看到我的鞋子像蒜頭瓣一樣分開......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪格娜嚇壞了，那雖然是場意外，但是她從此以後對我寸步不離，生怕我一個不注意又掉到哪裡去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軟綿綿的生物像是聽懂了什麼，它回過頭上下看了看凱勒。\n像是擔心一樣，它用頭撞了撞凱勒的腳踝，還試圖吃掉她的鞋跟，讓她走起路來舒服一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就像媽媽會擔心我又受到什麼傷害一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪格娜？她對我的關心，怎麼可能和對你的是一樣的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉......我有些走神了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你出生後，我偶爾也來看過你，就在想，你和他們長得可真像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你現在做著和他們一樣的工作，這種感覺......就像是他們的一部分從來沒有離開過，還一直在一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他們要是還一直在就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空氣中傳來海風鹹澀的氣味，軟綿綿的生物奔跑起來。未建成地塊的塔吊頂端出現在地平線上，凱勒快步走向前方，回過頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪格娜曾經和我說過，我們就像幾隻小小的螻蟻，站在這山川上，還大放厥詞試圖征服它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛爾，你看我們現在，兩隻小小的螻蟻站在這地塊上，面對著這比我們高大數十倍的建築。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我原本以為我會和之前那樣，覺得我很渺小，甚至不算什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）但我現在才發現有些事情原來這麼難以說出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凱勒老師，您說什麼——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......阿黛爾，我該怎麼把它告訴你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡還能看到一點老汐斯塔，再往那邊，就是汐斯塔火山了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道它到底哪一天才會真正地噴發呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "背著礦燈的生物也停下了腳步，呆呆地望向老汐斯塔的方向。\n海浪一下一下地拍打著遠處的沙礫，海平面閃閃發光，像是寶石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等它爆發，等博物館布置完，我的事情也就算做完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，阿黛爾，佔用你這麼久時間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完全沒有，凱勒老師，父母的這些事除了您以外，再也不會有其他人告訴我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很高興能知道這些事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凱勒站起身子，拍拍身上的土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您這就要走了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像你說的那個夢一樣，或許我也要去什麼商店去買一點勇氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走啦，阿黛爾，我們明天再見吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好好休息，不要太累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿黛爾看了看呆呆遠望老汐斯塔的生物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再見，凱勒老師！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軟綿綿的生物站在沙灘上，一動不動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是找到了你在找的地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿黛爾在站著不動的生物旁坐下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜......你是不是一位礦工，想回到這裡看看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "站著不動的生物甩了甩腦袋，收回自己望向大海的目光，轉頭看向身旁的阿黛爾。那是一雙澄澈的眼睛。\n它咀嚼著一串舊路牌，蹄子有規律地踢踩著地面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咚咚、咚咚、咚咚......\n它慢悠悠地，轉身離開了這片區域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g12_obsidianhotspringshotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別別別！我只是一個喜歡收藏這些寶貝石頭的大叔，守著這家旅館，可做不了你說的那些，也幫不了你什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些工人們都說了，布朗先生，您的父親之前就是礦場主人，他們給您工作了很多年，搬遷以後您也在一直偷偷幫他們日子好過點——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，那就對了。我父親的礦場導致了他們患病，我又在屋子裡擺滿這種他們冒著風險採來的石頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫他們？哪有。他們現在也算不上好，頂多算有個活幹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您承認了是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有！我的天，你說話就說話，別一驚一乍地碰壞了我的藏品！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那我們就說回藏品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些黑曜石在汐斯塔搬遷之前是極為珍貴的礦石，但只有足夠純淨，或是能反射出各色光芒的黑曜石才能賣出好價格，你肯定是知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "錫蘭彎腰從櫃子後面拖出兩箱礦石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那這些是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一個收藏家，為什麼會有這樣粗糙的、不純的、我在走訪工人時在他們家中看到的私採黑曜石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，你哪裡懂我的寶貝，黑曜石在我眼中都是好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你為什麼不再讓那些工人繼續挖，為你挖到死，反而把他們一個個安排好，去當司機，當售票員，當保全？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是他們自己給自己謀的生路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，那就是你順水推舟，同時拐彎抹角地賺他們的錢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，太對了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你為什麼就是不願意承認呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們現在也活得並不好，他們挖來的黑曜石撐起了汐斯塔，但是現在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佩利佩嘆了口氣，坐到了座位上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小丫頭，你以為改變一個城市的政策，就那麼容易嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看他們現在，看看我現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛才說聽他們叫我“布朗先生”，布朗礦業，整個礦業在我手裡，我也沒法直接為他們造個工廠，讓他們好好地生活在裡面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "政府會找上我，同行會算計我，外面有哥倫比亞，還有維多利亞，我們縮在汐斯塔這裡，已經很不錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不會......不知道哥倫比亞會讓感染者們交那些天價的保險，然後去荒地上拓荒吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我才來尋求您的幫助！您比我知道得更多，見識得更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥倫比亞用感染者問題來攻擊我們，我們就可以先建好我們自己的感染者地塊。同行會算計，我們可以想辦法和他們協商。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總能做到的。總不能就縮在這樣一個溫泉旅館裡，這能改變什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "錫蘭激動起來，她覺得自己的心臟快要跳出胸腔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是汐斯塔現在能有資本和哥倫比亞談的最好的方法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷茫的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可您看起來是不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是呢，已經五個月了，醫生說，是一個女孩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷茫的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恭喜您了！但，那您還......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汐斯塔要發展起來，不能再等了，所以我要來幫這些工人，我要教會他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要讓他們知道怎麼避開危險，怎麼觀察環境，怎麼在發生了災難後盡可能地保護住自己，他們全靠經驗，我能教給他們知識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷茫的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是這樣有用嗎？礦場這麼大，這麼多人不識字，他們只知道賺錢。父親說，那些事情很平常，而且工人總是很多，不要去在意這個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那還是不一樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "湯姆會在意，漢克會在意，比爾會在意，很多工人都會在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還想促進推行一項法案，就是針對這些工人們的現狀的。這些因為開採黑曜石而感染礦石病的人，應該得到更好的照顧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷茫的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可父親告訴我，現在政府根本不可能有空管這個，他們只想賺錢，賺更多的錢，好讓汐斯塔發展起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就由我來讓他們注意到這裡。總不能讓我捧著一肚子知識坐在辦公室裡，看著他們一個個受傷生病吧。這能做到什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女士溫柔地撫摸著自己隆起的腹部，裡面正安然孕育著一個小小的生命，她能感受到那個小小心跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咚咚、咚咚、咚咚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷茫的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐......請問您的名字是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g12_obsidianhotspringshotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小丫頭，你叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......以後我說不定還能在哪裡遇到你。要是你真的能做到點什麼，我會幫你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芭芭拉·道爾科斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的學者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以直接叫我芭芭拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g12_obsidianhotspringshotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錫蘭。錫蘭·道爾科斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我記住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......道爾科斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡已經是風情街附近了，你這是要去哪裡啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小黑羊，你背上的礦燈究竟是代表著什麼呢......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軟綿綿的生物悠然前進，它一邊尋找，一邊咀嚼。耳邊流過風聲，人流聲，遠遠地，還有火山活動的聲音傳來。\n咚咚、咚咚、咚咚......！\n有些聲音像炸雷一樣響在它的耳朵裡，蓋過了地質活動，岩漿的流淌。\n咚咚......！咚咚......！咚咚......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "它茫然地停在路中央，幾次無序地轉頭之後，這個慢悠悠的生物突然邁開四腿，奔跑起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......你要去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你找到了嗎？就在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g12_obsidianhotspringshotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芭芭拉是你的母親？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，這個是......這個是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佩利佩站上椅子，從櫃頂拿下一個精緻的盒子。在玻璃護罩後，一塊巨大的、未經雕琢的晶洞靜靜地放在那裡，黑曜石結晶閃閃發光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，等一下，我應該要把他們也叫來，這是他們寄存在我這裡的......湯姆、漢克，還有比爾，我要把這些老傢伙都叫過來......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芭芭拉是我的母親沒有錯......布朗先生，這是什麼？湯姆、漢克、比爾都是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錫蘭·道爾科斯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是很久之前，那些工人們想送給你母親的禮物。為了祝賀你的出生，為了感謝她的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "送給母親的禮物？我的母親......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這份禮物最終沒有送出去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等那些老工人來了，我要告訴他們，我要和他們一起把它交給你——你的母親她......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咚咚、咚咚、咚咚......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咚咚......！咚咚......！咚咚......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小黑羊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一隻軟綿綿的生物踏進旅店的大門，什麼聲音在指引著它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咚咚......！咚咚......！咚咚......！\n這個聲音來自一位女士正因情緒激動而起伏著的胸膛。\n心臟在蹦跳。一下，一下，它傳送著血液，到達人體的四肢百骸，它輸送著營養，從母親的身體，到達一個正在腹中安睡著的小小嬰孩。\n那個小小的心跳長大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咚咚......！咚咚......！咚咚......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軟綿綿的生物將頭靠在錫蘭的胸前。\n錫蘭什麼都沒有看到，但她感受到了一陣突如其來的溫暖。\n沉沉的，彷彿有什麼東西落進她的懷裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錫蘭小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......艾雅法拉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "錫蘭突然覺得自己能看到什麼，她的懷抱越加沉重起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一隻小羊逐漸出現在她視野中——它的腦袋靠著自己的胸膛，正在靜靜地聆聽著什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咚咚！咚咚！錫蘭的心臟正在劇烈地蹦跳著，發出只有她和小羊能聽到的轟然巨響。\n她看到小羊用鼻尖輕輕觸碰了一下那塊晶洞，又用額頭抵住自己的額頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......小黑羊她......不再迷路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她好像找到她要找的東西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷路......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呦——這個晶洞可不能倒啊——它摔碎了我真的是沒臉再見任何人了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小羊輕巧地從錫蘭的懷中躍下，一溜煙消失在了煙霧中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾雅法拉......那是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也看到了，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是告別吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是告別吧......也是重逢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
